{"3879070": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "He Followed Me", "steam_appid": 3879070, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>HE FOLLOWED ME</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;HE FOLLOWED ME&quot; is an episodic psychological horror game</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BASED ON A TRUE STORY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PLOT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>I never thought something small could turn into something like this. It started with an argument at work. Nothing serious. Just words. But after that… I kept seeing the same car. Outside the restaurant. Across the street from my house. Near the market late at night. At first, I told myself I was overthinking it. Until the night he followed me home.</strong> <strong></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAMEPLAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In He Followed Me, you step into the role of an ordinary man working on a pizzeria place living a normal life — work, friends, late-night routines. What begins as a simple disagreement slowly turns into a disturbing pattern. A car keeps appearing wherever you go. Watching. Waiting. Explore everyday environments like your home, workplace, and neighborhood as tension builds through subtle details and psychological pressure. someone is always there. , Will you survive the night — or was it already too late?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric environment and photo-realistic graphics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > VHS film aesthetic. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Receive texts from NPCs. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Talk to NPCs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Controls WASD - Move</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > LMB - Interact</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > ESC - Chats menu </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Left SHIFT - Move faster</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>HE FOLLOWED ME</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;HE FOLLOWED ME&quot; is an episodic psychological horror game</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BASED ON A TRUE STORY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PLOT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>I never thought something small could turn into something like this. It started with an argument at work. Nothing serious. Just words. But after that… I kept seeing the same car. Outside the restaurant. Across the street from my house. Near the market late at night. At first, I told myself I was overthinking it. Until the night he followed me home.</strong> <strong></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAMEPLAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In He Followed Me, you step into the role of an ordinary man working on a pizzeria place living a normal life — work, friends, late-night routines. What begins as a simple disagreement slowly turns into a disturbing pattern. A car keeps appearing wherever you go. Watching. Waiting. Explore everyday environments like your home, workplace, and neighborhood as tension builds through subtle details and psychological pressure. someone is always there. , Will you survive the night — or was it already too late?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric environment and photo-realistic graphics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > VHS film aesthetic. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Receive texts from NPCs. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Talk to NPCs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Controls WASD - Move</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > LMB - Interact</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > ESC - Chats menu </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Left SHIFT - Move faster</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "He Followed Me is a psychological horror experience about an ordinary man who begins noticing the same car outside the places he visits. What starts as a minor disagreement slowly turns into something far more unsettling. Sometimes, the scariest things aren’t supernatural… they’re real.", "supported_languages": "English", "reviews": "“ZestosYtStudios”<br>ZestosYtStudios – ZestosYtStudios<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879070/d0c96b3497a91f8c6de21393d37b4fa4e87d263b/header.jpg?t=1772648555", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879070/b60bced04a323924e2d1d930c8380120108c0e85/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772648555", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879070/b60bced04a323924e2d1d930c8380120108c0e85/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772648555", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64Bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Interl (R) Core(TM) i5-3300<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GT 1030<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 12 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11 64Bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Interl (R) Core(TM) i5-10300K<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 1660 TI<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Stora